{"reviewId": "363182609_8443SsDxH", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "个人观点：如果按照黄金-原油的兑换比例，可能有三种回归路径：①黄金跌②原油涨③黄金慢涨/横盘，原油快涨。但随着人民币国际化的进程可能会打破这个惯性格局：1，人民币正成为国际能源结算主导货币（减少美元主导）；2，正建立以人民币计价的大宗商品定价中心（上海能源期货做市深化）；3，以黄金作为人名币信用背书；4，去石油化与扩容替代能源…，待到人民币站稳脚跟，现在黄金的高点可能是以后的低点/回落稳定/横盘；所以黄金长期看涨。", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "每盎司黄金兑换10～15桶原油", "range": "24849-24864", "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "363182609_8443SsDxH", "userVid": 363182609, "topics": [], "createTime": 1761038057, "userEditTime": 1761054361, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 363182609, "name": "       ", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0019-rbxn9E6mTegMEgduo2tQe10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M8-202411-40", "desc": "每月阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读月", "levelIndex": 40}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 10, "likes": [{"userVid": 299540178, "name": "富江爱好者、🍑", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0021-qnj76HaAdK4r~ei1Mbp5199/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-200", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 200}}], "commentsCount": 4, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "人民币在国际能源结算中占比还非常小，成为主导货币还有很长的路要走", "reviewId": "363182609_8443SsDxH", "commentId": "363182609_8443SsDxH_c27369954_8bTjFk3sI", "userVid": 273699